Package: tubeos-ui
Version: 0.2.0
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: openbox, xserver-xorg, xinit, unclutter, picom, curl, feh, libwebkit2gtk-4.1-0, libgtk-3-0
Maintainer: Inled Pulsar OS Team <team@inled.es>
Description: Tube OS TV UI Shell (Openbox + tvOS-style launcher)
 Lightweight Smart TV user interface shell and session for Tube OS.
 Launches Openbox window manager with the tvOS-style Tauri launcher in kiosk mode.
